WEBVTT

00:01.490 --> 00:02.940
<i>Before the spring recess,</i>

00:03.350 --> 00:06.860
<i>I tried to invite Yumiella 
to the margrave's domain...</i>

00:07.410 --> 00:11.120
Yumiella, do you have any 
plans for the break?

00:11.510 --> 00:13.990
If you don't... um...

00:13.990 --> 00:16.750
Oh, I have somewhere I need to go.

00:16.750 --> 00:19.740
Y-You do? A vacation?

00:19.740 --> 00:23.250
Something like that.
You're going back home, right?

00:23.250 --> 00:27.170
Y-Yeah. Since I stayed here 
through the summer and all.

00:27.170 --> 00:29.210
So, if it's okay with you, well...

00:29.210 --> 00:32.890
I see. So the next time we meet 
will be during the new term.

00:33.610 --> 00:35.020
I guess so...

00:35.680 --> 00:37.890
<i>...and I never actually got 
a chance to invite her.</i>

00:38.550 --> 00:41.900
<i>During the recess, I went into 
dungeons every day to train...</i>

00:44.080 --> 00:44.940
<i>and train...</i>

00:46.270 --> 00:47.370
<i>and train!</i>

00:52.050 --> 00:53.730
<i>Spring already...</i>

00:56.550 --> 00:58.790
<i>And now, it's the first day of the new term...</i>

01:00.440 --> 01:01.930
<i>the start of our second year.</i>

01:02.710 --> 01:05.210
<i>And in the auditorium, before 
the opening ceremony,</i>

01:05.970 --> 01:08.460
<i>I saw all of my classmates again...</i>

01:09.490 --> 01:12.970
<i>and one of them was holding some weird egg.</i>

01:13.580 --> 01:15.230
Yumiella, good to see you again.

01:15.230 --> 01:17.170
Patrick. Same to you.

01:17.170 --> 01:19.980
Sorry to make this the first 
thing I ask you, but...

01:20.910 --> 01:22.480
What's with the egg?

01:23.450 --> 01:24.480
It's my child.

01:24.700 --> 01:25.420
Huh?

01:26.110 --> 01:27.790
What?!

01:53.270 --> 01:56.890
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

01:53.690 --> 01:56.890
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

02:59.950 --> 03:02.100
<i>Before the long spring recess,</i>

03:02.100 --> 03:05.510
<i>a certain girl from school sought my advice.</i>

03:05.510 --> 03:08.790
M-Miss Yumiella, I was 
hoping to talk to you...

03:09.340 --> 03:10.480
About what?

03:10.480 --> 03:12.120
W-Well, you see...

03:12.750 --> 03:15.550
<i>Her name is Jessica Monford.</i>

03:15.550 --> 03:19.570
Jessica

03:15.550 --> 03:19.570
Will you go shopping with me sometime?

03:15.830 --> 03:18.630
<i>In the game, she becomes 
Alicia's closest friend,</i>

03:18.630 --> 03:21.090
<i>but as of right now,
they don't seem all that close.</i>

03:19.570 --> 03:26.560
Alicia

03:19.570 --> 03:26.560
Sure, Jessica. I wanted to buy
ingredients to make sweets, anyway.

03:21.550 --> 03:25.560
<i>That's probably because I've 
changed how the story goes.</i>

03:26.910 --> 03:30.310
The thing is... I have a favor to ask!

03:31.110 --> 03:33.820
A dragon has taken up residence on a mountain

03:33.820 --> 03:36.190
in the Monford domain, my family's land.

03:36.570 --> 03:39.030
Fortunately, it hasn't taken any lives yet,

03:39.030 --> 03:41.810
but if nothing is done, 
it's just a matter of time.

03:42.310 --> 03:45.580
The local soldiers are nowhere 
near capable of fighting a dragon,

03:45.850 --> 03:47.770
and if we wait for the military to arrive,

03:47.770 --> 03:49.870
there's no telling how long it'll take.

03:51.000 --> 03:54.440
I thought maybe you could 
do something about it...

03:54.440 --> 03:55.590
I understand.

03:57.550 --> 04:00.960
<i>Frankly, when Jessica asked me 
to do this, I was surprised.</i>

04:01.300 --> 04:04.370
<i>I wasn't expecting this event to hit me.</i>

04:05.300 --> 04:07.490
Let's go slay the dragon.

04:13.360 --> 04:15.480
So it's a red dragon...

04:15.480 --> 04:18.050
Which means its attribute would be fire.

04:18.050 --> 04:21.700
Y-Yes. That's what my 
father said in his letter.

04:22.450 --> 04:24.420
<i>Okay. Just like in the game.</i>

04:26.970 --> 04:28.810
Thank you for inviting me here.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.970
I'm Yumiella Dolkness.

04:31.380 --> 04:33.440
Thank you so much for coming.

04:33.440 --> 04:37.310
Jessica said in her letter that 
you were like a Demon Lord.

04:37.310 --> 04:39.620
I didn't say she was like a Demon Lord!

04:39.620 --> 04:42.970
I said she was strong enough 
to <i>defeat</i> the Demon Lord!

04:43.240 --> 04:46.270
Miss Yumiella is level 99, you know!

04:46.270 --> 04:50.730
Level 99? A little lady like her?

04:51.310 --> 04:53.980
<i>Wow, I haven't experienced this in a while.</i>

04:54.830 --> 04:59.990
<b>The Hidden Boss Meets a Dragon</b>

05:03.790 --> 05:08.250
Hey, why do we have to do 
what a little rich girl says?

05:08.250 --> 05:12.310
What choice do we have?
It's Baron Monford's orders.

05:12.760 --> 05:17.230
<i>I can hear you. My ears are level 99, too.</i>

05:21.600 --> 05:23.430
Is something the matter?

05:23.430 --> 05:25.390
If you're tired, we can rest.

05:25.950 --> 05:26.620
It's here.

05:26.620 --> 05:27.180
Huh?

05:34.860 --> 05:36.290
There it is!

05:41.190 --> 05:42.650
Miss, you must run, too! Hurry!

05:43.060 --> 05:44.670
Stay there and don't move.

05:54.870 --> 05:55.830
Black Hole.

06:11.630 --> 06:12.910
Sh-She did it!

06:12.910 --> 06:14.560
And in one attack... Wow...

06:15.370 --> 06:16.950
It's not over yet.

06:18.290 --> 06:20.650
<i>I know because I played the game.</i>

06:21.220 --> 06:24.270
<i>There's not one dragon
on this mountain, there's two.</i>

06:24.730 --> 06:27.320
<i>So if they focus only on 
countering the fire one,</i>

06:27.910 --> 06:31.500
<i>they'll be taken out by the other, a 
green dragon whose attribute is wind.</i>

06:31.500 --> 06:32.990
<i>The whole event's a trap.</i>

06:41.270 --> 06:42.590
Look out!

06:43.440 --> 06:44.790
Shadow Lance.

06:52.610 --> 06:53.650
Now...

06:54.130 --> 06:56.730
<i>There's one more thing I need to do.</i>

07:03.610 --> 07:05.980
<i>It's those dragons' egg.</i>

07:07.690 --> 07:10.400
Huh? Your... child?

07:10.400 --> 07:12.410
Yes. I laid it.

07:12.410 --> 07:14.390
Y-You and who?!

07:14.390 --> 07:15.570
It was a joke.

07:15.570 --> 07:17.670
Oh... A joke.

07:18.390 --> 07:21.260
<i>Does he think I could lay an egg?</i>

07:23.370 --> 07:24.920
It's a dragon egg.

07:25.150 --> 07:27.150
Some things happened during the recess.

07:27.150 --> 07:30.480
Most people don't get a dragon 
egg by doing "some things."

07:31.420 --> 07:33.550
Are you going to hatch it?

07:33.550 --> 07:34.980
That's the plan.

07:34.980 --> 07:38.310
I got permission from the 
king and the principal.

07:38.410 --> 07:42.610
Alicia

07:38.410 --> 07:42.610
The egg is shining gold!

07:39.420 --> 07:42.280
<i>In the game, Alicia's magic causes the egg</i>

07:42.280 --> 07:44.640
<i>to hatch into a light-attribute dragon,</i>

07:42.610 --> 07:47.860
Alicia

07:42.610 --> 07:47.860
(The light dragon rose into the sky,
carrying us on its back.)

07:44.640 --> 07:47.860
<i>and it grows big enough to 
carry the party on its back.</i>

07:48.250 --> 07:53.230
<i>The whole point of the dragon-slaying 
event was to give them a means of travel.</i>

07:53.990 --> 07:58.060
<i>Of course, the goal is to help 
people who are in trouble,</i>

07:58.060 --> 08:00.320
<i>but the event's reward was too enticing.</i>

08:00.970 --> 08:05.510
<i>It could help me flee the 
kingdom if I ever wanted to.</i>

08:05.510 --> 08:09.510
<i>Also, calling it my child 
wasn't entirely wrong.</i>

08:10.450 --> 08:13.990
<i>Dragons hatch their eggs by 
filling them with their magic.</i>

08:14.450 --> 08:16.270
<i>The more magic they give it,</i>

08:16.520 --> 08:18.550
<i>the stronger the hatchling will be.</i>

08:19.010 --> 08:20.810
<i>And when it hatches,</i>

08:20.810 --> 08:24.270
<i>it recognizes the one who 
gave it magic as its parent.</i>

08:24.970 --> 08:27.290
<i>Even if that parent is 
of a different species.</i>

08:28.990 --> 08:32.530
I spent the entire recess giving it magic.

08:33.230 --> 08:36.730
<i>And as that went on, I became attached to it.</i>

08:37.310 --> 08:41.640
<i>At first, I only thought of it as a way 
to get my hands on a convenient taxi...</i>

08:42.470 --> 08:44.740
<i>But since it's going to 
be born with my magic,</i>

08:44.740 --> 08:46.610
<i>it might as well be my baby.</i>

08:52.880 --> 08:54.430
There's two of them!

08:56.770 --> 08:58.020
It looks so sinister.

08:58.290 --> 09:00.800
And that's putting it lightly.

09:00.800 --> 09:03.100
Don't say mean things about my baby.

09:03.440 --> 09:05.100
Look how lovable it is!

09:05.800 --> 09:07.610
Lovable?

09:07.870 --> 09:11.630
Yes. It's going to be the 
cutest dragon in the world.

09:11.630 --> 09:17.370
Oh... So you're not trying to bring the 
strongest dragon ever into the world?

09:17.570 --> 09:21.370
It's my baby. Of course it'll 
be the strongest dragon ever.

09:21.620 --> 09:26.880
Okay, I get it. I'll be praying 
that it hatches safely.

09:27.640 --> 09:31.110
<i>Did I say something really crazy?</i>

09:34.660 --> 09:36.890
<i>It's a sign that the egg's about to hatch!</i>

09:37.350 --> 09:39.190
Patrick, come with me!

09:41.620 --> 09:43.940
Welcome, Master Ashbatten.

09:44.150 --> 09:48.120
Come in. This is your first 
time coming here, isn't it?

09:48.120 --> 09:49.440
H-Here I am...

09:50.390 --> 09:54.830
<i>Wait, is he embarrassed 
to be in a girl's room?</i>

09:59.660 --> 10:01.080
It moved again!

10:01.400 --> 10:05.200
Is that egg... really going to hatch?

10:05.200 --> 10:06.410
Of course.

10:08.190 --> 10:10.410
Is it time yet? Is it time yet?

10:10.410 --> 10:13.350
I can tell by how it's moving 
that it'll be adorable!

10:18.510 --> 10:20.210
Patrick! Look, look!

10:19.050 --> 10:22.440
Ow, ow, ow! My arm! My arm!

10:22.440 --> 10:24.480
Come on! You can do it!

10:29.480 --> 10:32.050
Yes! It's happening, Patrick!

10:30.550 --> 10:33.360
Quit grabbing my arm!

10:34.400 --> 10:37.450
Keep it up! Patrick, you cheer it on, too!

10:37.450 --> 10:38.120
You can do it...

10:38.120 --> 10:40.280
Louder!

10:40.280 --> 10:41.920
You can do it! You can do it!

10:41.920 --> 10:43.630
You can do it! You can do it!

10:54.750 --> 10:58.140
I know you were expecting 
a really cute dragon...

10:58.370 --> 11:02.360
But I think being scary—er, 
cool—is good, too.

11:02.360 --> 11:03.350
How cute...

11:03.350 --> 11:03.890
Huh?

11:04.850 --> 11:06.490
How is it so adorable?

11:06.490 --> 11:07.400
Eh?

11:08.410 --> 11:11.110
<i>It has such a sublime look.</i>

11:11.110 --> 11:17.410
<i>And its black body proves that it 
absorbed plenty of my dark magic.</i>

11:18.500 --> 11:20.870
<i>The apple really didn't 
fall far from the tree.</i>

11:23.750 --> 11:26.670
If you think it's cute, 
that's fine, I guess...

11:28.670 --> 11:31.870
It's purring like a cat.

11:31.870 --> 11:33.940
Sounds more like it's growling.

11:33.940 --> 11:35.880
What should I name it?

11:35.880 --> 11:37.680
A dragon... "ryu"...

11:37.890 --> 11:40.180
Why don't you just call it "Ryu"?

11:40.460 --> 11:42.930
Huh? No, "ryu" actually means...

11:43.670 --> 11:47.490
<i>Oh, right. They don't have 
that word in this world,</i>

11:47.490 --> 11:48.940
<i>so it must sound like a name.</i>

11:49.340 --> 11:52.250
It does have a nice ring to it. I like it.

11:52.250 --> 11:53.060
Ryu.

11:54.000 --> 11:55.940
Your name is Ryu.

11:58.890 --> 12:02.190
Ryu, don't release your breath indoors.

12:06.410 --> 12:07.890
Don't do that, either.

12:10.930 --> 12:15.210
Patrick, I need to put Ryu to 
bed, so that's all for today.

12:15.210 --> 12:17.590
You're going to keep a dragon in here?!

12:17.830 --> 12:21.560
Of course. It'll sleep in my 
bed with me until it's too big.

12:21.560 --> 12:25.450
I see... Well, if anyone can handle 
it, you can, but try not to die. Bye!

12:25.450 --> 12:27.600
I-I must take my leave, as well.

12:31.750 --> 12:34.860
Maybe Patrick and Rita just 
don't care much for animals.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.240
You're so cute!

12:42.770 --> 12:44.480
Goodnight, Ryu.

12:53.410 --> 12:55.110
What's wrong, Rita?

12:57.290 --> 12:59.730
<i>They do say kids grow up quickly,</i>

13:00.310 --> 13:01.690
<i>but </i>this<i> quickly?</i>

13:02.730 --> 13:05.070
<i>How am I going to get him out of my room?</i>

13:06.850 --> 13:10.020
Come on, Ryu, this way. It's not scary.

13:10.900 --> 13:12.020
Come, Ryu.

13:19.630 --> 13:22.430
Good job, Ryu. You did it.

13:22.780 --> 13:27.540
I need to find you a place to live. 
It should be close to my room...

13:29.510 --> 13:31.250
Wh-What is that?!

13:31.250 --> 13:34.170
What? What happened?

13:34.170 --> 13:36.950
A dragon! There's a dragon here!

13:36.950 --> 13:39.610
A dragon? One showed up here, too?

13:39.610 --> 13:40.520
Whoa...

13:41.290 --> 13:44.060
Dragons grow that much overnight?

13:44.060 --> 13:47.030
Patrick, it sounds like a dragon's shown up,

13:47.030 --> 13:48.770
but I can't find any trace of it.

13:49.030 --> 13:50.860
Uh, it's right behind you.

13:50.860 --> 13:51.570
Huh?

13:51.890 --> 13:54.920
Oh, all that fuss was over Ryu?

13:54.920 --> 13:56.520
You should expect a fuss.

13:56.750 --> 13:58.750
Well, he <i>is</i> cute.

13:58.750 --> 14:01.680
He might be the most popular 
guy at school soon.

14:01.680 --> 14:02.280
Huh?

14:02.540 --> 14:04.860
Ryu, want to go play with everyone?

14:13.070 --> 14:13.780
Why?

14:13.780 --> 14:16.040
Stop him, Yumiella! Get Ryu back here!

14:17.790 --> 14:19.750
Ryu, come on back.

14:22.270 --> 14:25.370
<i>There are people out there 
who don't like animals.</i>

14:25.710 --> 14:28.170
<i>I have to accept and respect that.</i>

14:29.120 --> 14:31.000
You like Ryu, don't you, Patrick?

14:31.000 --> 14:31.700
Uh...

14:32.300 --> 14:35.560
Cuteness aside, I do think 
he's a very clever dragon.

14:36.290 --> 14:39.440
But it's dangerous to let 
him play with normal people.

14:44.680 --> 14:48.070
<i>Oh, I love it! I wish 
he'd do that to me, too!</i>

14:49.940 --> 14:51.920
Ryu, that's enough.

14:54.470 --> 14:58.590
Are you okay? Does stuff like 
animal drool bother you?

14:59.570 --> 15:02.130
I'll consider myself lucky just to be alive.

15:02.840 --> 15:05.090
I-Is this your doing, too?!

15:05.460 --> 15:09.210
His name is Ryu. I've received 
permission to raise him.

15:09.210 --> 15:10.350
Be serious!

15:10.700 --> 15:13.590
You can't keep a monster 
this dangerous at school!

15:13.590 --> 15:14.100
Get rid of—

15:15.080 --> 15:16.480
Your Highness!

15:17.730 --> 15:18.790
Ed!

15:20.470 --> 15:21.610
Ed!

15:21.930 --> 15:23.790
Ryu, stop that.

15:22.180 --> 15:26.400
Ed! Ed!

15:23.790 --> 15:26.400
Don't get so comfortable with 
people you've never met.

15:28.330 --> 15:29.660
Ed, hang in there!

15:31.030 --> 15:34.370
I'll see that you pay for this humiliation!

15:34.370 --> 15:36.160
Ed, are you okay?

15:36.390 --> 15:38.990
Yeah... Sorry, Alicia.

15:39.570 --> 15:41.940
I guess he doesn't like animals, either.

15:41.940 --> 15:44.450
I don't think that's the problem.

15:44.450 --> 15:45.670
Oh, my!

15:46.930 --> 15:49.180
Who's this adorable little guy?

15:49.530 --> 15:52.640
<i>Ooh! Eleonora likes animals!</i>

15:52.640 --> 15:53.930
<i>That's surprising!</i>

15:54.190 --> 15:55.580
His name is Ryu.

15:55.930 --> 15:57.810
He is cute, isn't he?

15:59.130 --> 16:00.820
May I touch him?

16:00.820 --> 16:01.190
Yes.

16:02.330 --> 16:04.680
You really are adorable!

16:05.420 --> 16:08.010
Why don't you come closer to everyone?

16:11.130 --> 16:14.310
Oh, do you like this?

16:14.310 --> 16:16.450
I see we share a love of fine jewels.

16:18.210 --> 16:20.960
Ryu, go fetch!

16:27.090 --> 16:30.590
I see. It was the necklace Ryu liked.

16:32.580 --> 16:34.330
Ryu, that's enough.

16:36.990 --> 16:38.850
I thought I was a goner!

16:39.060 --> 16:40.700
They say it's a big world,

16:40.700 --> 16:44.860
but I'm sure I'm the only daughter of 
nobility who's been chewed on by a dragon!

16:45.540 --> 16:50.120
This should make Prince 
Edwin like me even more!

16:50.120 --> 16:52.370
Uh, I'm not sure about that...

16:52.940 --> 16:54.530
Prince Edwin...

16:55.330 --> 16:57.250
We'll have to do something about him.

16:57.640 --> 16:58.970
Did you say something?

16:58.970 --> 17:01.410
No, just talking to myself.

17:04.090 --> 17:07.340
It was decided that Ryu would live 
in a storehouse on school grounds.

17:07.340 --> 17:09.840
I'll have to visit him frequently.

17:12.620 --> 17:15.810
Did you hear there's a 
student who's level 99?

17:16.650 --> 17:18.470
That's her! The dangerous one!

17:18.470 --> 17:19.290
Huh?

17:20.010 --> 17:22.430
Patrick, do you have plans after this?

17:22.430 --> 17:24.770
Yeah, but I can spare a little time.

17:24.770 --> 17:28.280
You've seemed busy lately. 
What are you up to?

17:28.280 --> 17:31.030
Oh, nothing...

17:31.970 --> 17:35.010
Just... Just wait a little longer.

17:35.010 --> 17:38.120
There's something I want to 
tell you when the time comes.

17:38.610 --> 17:39.790
There is?

17:41.710 --> 17:42.920
I'm not certain,

17:43.210 --> 17:48.080
but what you want to tell me might 
be the same thing I want to tell you.

17:48.080 --> 17:50.350
Huh? You mean...

17:50.850 --> 17:52.680
No, wait! I want to say it!

17:53.000 --> 17:54.600
So do I.

17:54.600 --> 17:57.170
Depending on how it ends, it could be fun,

17:57.170 --> 17:58.430
or it could be painful.

17:58.790 --> 18:01.390
But I think it's important to take that step.

18:02.080 --> 18:04.690
Okay, then let's say it at the same time.

18:05.430 --> 18:07.190
Patrick, I...

18:07.410 --> 18:09.650
Yumiella, I...

18:10.040 --> 18:12.360
...want to fly through the sky with Ryu!

18:12.360 --> 18:13.450
What?!

18:14.150 --> 18:17.280
You want to... fly? On Ryu?

18:17.280 --> 18:19.750
Yeah, but I'm a bit scared.

18:19.750 --> 18:22.570
So I was hoping you would accompany me.

18:23.770 --> 18:24.830
What is it?

18:25.990 --> 18:28.690
I'm not that interested in flying.

18:28.690 --> 18:29.340
Huh?

18:29.560 --> 18:32.230
Then what was it you wanted to say?

18:32.950 --> 18:35.610
It's surprising that you're afraid to fly.

18:36.030 --> 18:38.100
I thought you feared nothing.

18:38.570 --> 18:40.950
<i>He's obviously changing the subject.</i>

18:40.950 --> 18:44.190
<i>Well, thinking that we had 
the same thing in mind</i>

18:44.190 --> 18:48.460
<i>and then finding out we didn't is 
pretty embarrassing, I suppose.</i>

18:55.200 --> 18:56.870
He grew even bigger.

18:57.730 --> 18:58.870
What's that ring?

18:59.330 --> 19:01.700
It shows that he belongs to the kingdom.

19:01.700 --> 19:04.260
It prevents him from being 
mistaken for a wild dragon.

19:04.260 --> 19:05.500
Huh...

19:05.720 --> 19:09.350
The flying part is fine.
It's falling that I'm afraid of.

19:09.350 --> 19:14.310
If anyone's standing where I land, 
I'll be fine, but they won't be.

19:14.310 --> 19:17.320
Oh... It's not yourself you're worried about?

19:17.320 --> 19:18.960
Still, I'm going to try it.

19:18.960 --> 19:22.950
Ryu, I'm going to ride on you today, okay?

19:24.150 --> 19:26.880
If you're worried, maybe you shouldn't do it?

19:27.230 --> 19:28.150
It's okay.

19:28.420 --> 19:30.270
I feel like it's now or never.

19:31.300 --> 19:34.470
<i>Yumiella's the most dangerous 
when she's confident.</i>

19:34.850 --> 19:37.200
<i>It's just my rule of thumb, 
but it's never been wrong.</i>

19:41.870 --> 19:44.660
Ryu, let's go! Beyond the skies!

19:51.150 --> 19:52.960
Yumiella! Be careful!

19:53.270 --> 19:55.220
Watch me, Patrick!

20:05.520 --> 20:08.900
Ryu, everyone's watching. Say hello to them.

20:19.090 --> 20:20.450
Now do a loop-the-loop!

20:24.190 --> 20:24.890
Ah...

20:25.840 --> 20:28.250
I guess I got carried away.

20:29.190 --> 20:31.290
Ryu, can you make it home alone?

20:32.470 --> 20:35.470
Good boy. I'll be there waiting for you.

20:36.010 --> 20:40.010
<i>This is what I was worried about. 
I'll damage the town if I land.</i>

20:40.010 --> 20:42.080
<i>I can't use wind magic,</i>

20:42.080 --> 20:45.120
<i>but if I can just change the 
trajectory of my fall...</i>

20:56.730 --> 20:57.490
Yumiella!

20:58.390 --> 21:01.450
Sorry, Patrick. It didn't work after all.

21:06.530 --> 21:08.490
Okay! I'll take you to the nurse's office!

21:08.490 --> 21:08.830
Huh?

21:08.830 --> 21:11.510
Hang on. I can walk on my own.

21:11.510 --> 21:14.850
No, Yumiella's healing 
magic would be quicker!

21:14.850 --> 21:15.840
Where's Yumiella?!

21:16.220 --> 21:18.400
Patrick, I'm right here.

21:18.400 --> 21:20.490
O-Oh, right...

21:20.490 --> 21:24.350
Calm down. You know this 
isn't enough to hurt me.

21:24.350 --> 21:26.720
You need to take better care of yourself!

21:26.990 --> 21:30.280
Some people have the wrong idea 
about you, but you're human!

21:30.970 --> 21:33.730
<i>I think he just said something 
kind of mean to me...</i>

21:34.510 --> 21:37.980
<i>But I have to be grateful for his concern.</i>

21:37.980 --> 21:39.570
Come on, let's go.

21:40.050 --> 21:40.790
Sure.

21:44.110 --> 21:47.490
<i>A few days later, I headed into 
town for the first time in a while.</i>

21:48.860 --> 21:51.590
<i>Ryu was growing bigger and bigger,</i>

21:51.590 --> 21:54.790
<i>so I wanted to look for 
a saddle, a food bowl,</i>

21:54.790 --> 21:57.250
<i>educational toys, and other pet supplies.</i>

21:57.880 --> 22:00.610
I want you to hear me out 
without answering yet.

22:01.520 --> 22:04.510
I'm a spy from the Kingdom of Remlest.

22:05.480 --> 22:08.080
I'd like to have a word with you in private.
